  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 567da0f27ceb5364a9fea3c9364162c3, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1800314693709824
    m_Localized: Welcome
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1800347358949376
    m_Localized: 'Welcome to AUT-INC!

      You are the manager of a new IT company:
      your task is to manage employees and departments to help it grow. Get ready
      to make important decisions every week!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1800420423725056
    m_Localized: Game Objective
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1800447858667520
    m_Localized: 'Your goal?

      Grow your company without going bankrupt. To
      succeed, you will need to:

      - improve your departments,

      - unlock
      new ones,

      - accept the right projects from clients.

      The bigger
      you grow, the more opportunities will open up!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1800528586436608
    m_Localized: Main Interface
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1800558235971584
    m_Localized: 'From the main screen, you can keep everything under control:

      -
      departments,

      - employees,

      - ongoing projects.

      At the top
      left, you''ll find the essential information: number of employees, elapsed
      time, and available capital.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1800608940912640
    m_Localized: Time Management
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1800613319766016
    m_Localized: 'Time is precious.

      Every week that passes using play and
      pause buttons, projects move forward!

      - Manage time from the panel at
      the top: you can pause and resume it whenever you like.

      - When you open
      a menu (employees, projects, departments), the game automatically pauses.

      Remember
      to press "play" to start the game time whenever you feel ready.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1800786590658560
    m_Localized: Getting Started
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1800814117875712
    m_Localized: 'Is this your first time playing AUT-INC?

      To get oriented,
      I recommend opening the menus in this order:

      - Departments

      -
      Employees

      - Projects

      This way you''ll quickly understand how
      the company works.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1800890303213568
    m_Localized: A helpful tip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1800913753567232
    m_Localized: 'Want to succeed?

      Don''t focus only on profit: happy, well-organized
      employees are much more productive!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1804463497900032
    m_Localized: Departments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1804513217179648
    m_Localized: 'Each department includes a description of its activities and the
      skills required.

      Read this information carefully to understand which
      employees to assign and get the most out of your team.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1804551695724544
    m_Localized: Team Management
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1804574353354752
    m_Localized: 'Within each department, you can create one or more teams.

      Try
      to keep the number of teams close to the recommended value and respect employees''
      preferences for working alone or in a group to maximize productivity and team
      satisfaction.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1804665034207232
    m_Localized: Upgrade the Department
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1804748916092928
    m_Localized: 'You can upgrade a department to increase the maximum number of
      employees and its productivity.

      Keep in mind that upgrades may affect
      salaries and the recommended number of teams, so organize your team carefully.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1804796106207232
    m_Localized: Work Output
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1804833741697024
    m_Localized: 'Each employee produces up to 100 units of work per week.

      Increasing
      the department''s level allows you to hire more employees and increase production.

      Organize
      your teams effectively to get the most out of each department member.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1805028562923520
    m_Localized: Employee List
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1805057881108480
    m_Localized: 'Here you can see all your employees, organized by department and
      team.

      Towards the end of the list, you will find those who have been
      hired but are not yet active.

      Employees assigned to a department take
      on the department''s color in the list.

      Use the search function to find
      new candidates, but remember: each search has a cost!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1805139581956096
    m_Localized: Employee Details
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1805163527237632
    m_Localized: 'Select an employee to view their information and attributes.

      At
      any time, you can move an employee from one team to another, but be careful:
      moving or removing an employee may temporarily reduce the team''s mood and
      productivity.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1805211916922880
    m_Localized: Employee Productivity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1805246956138496
    m_Localized: 'Each employee can produce up to 100 units of work per week.

      Their
      effectiveness depends on their skills in the department and on their mood,
      which is influenced by the number of colleagues in the team.

      Assign
      each employee to the most suitable context to get the best performance out
      of them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1805331223900160
    m_Localized: Hiring New Employees
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1805372923670528
    m_Localized: 'Review the candidates'' profiles to understand who is best suited
      for the role.

      You can perform multiple consecutive searches, paying
      the associated cost.

      Warning:  candidates will change when you request
      a new search.

      Remember to assign new employees to departments before
      moving forward in the game.

      The first three searches are free!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1805659512074240
    m_Localized: Project List
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1805712922341376
    m_Localized: 'Here you can see all ongoing projects as well as proposed projects
      not yet accepted.

      Each project displays the remaining time and the work
      left to complete.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1805757205803008
    m_Localized: Project Details
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1805777598509056
    m_Localized: 'Select a project to see which departments are involved, how much
      work remains, and how many weeks are left.

      You can also view the financial
      details: advance payment, weekly payments, and final payment.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1805846259265536
    m_Localized: Projects and Departments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1805884054138880
    m_Localized: 'Some projects require the work of multiple departments simultaneously.

      Assign
      the right employees to each department to successfully complete the project.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1805953398566912
    m_Localized: Project Completion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1805979180953600
    m_Localized: 'A project is considered complete if finished within the deadline.

      The
      final payment increases or decreases depending on whether it is delivered early
      or late.

      If you cannot complete a project, you can cancel the contract
      by paying a penalty, freeing your employees to work on other tasks.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1806103017779200
    m_Localized: New Projects
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1806148668583936
    m_Localized: 'Every week, new projects arrive for evaluation.

      Check regularly
      the list of new projects list to discover interesting and profitable opportunities
      for your company.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1806390327603200
    m_Localized: Project Team
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1806418907590656
    m_Localized: 'Designed and developed by Daniele Gentile, from the Computer Science
      degree program of the Department of Computer Science at the Universita'' degli
      Studi di Bari Aldo Moro.

      Special thanks go to Prof.ssa Veronica Rossano
      for the supervision and support provided during the development of the thesis.

      The
      graphic part involved the collaboration of Vanessa Romano and Dario Gentile
      for the creation of the pixel art images.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1806893992210432
    m_Localized: The Project AUT-INC
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1806917635502080
    m_Localized: 'AUT-INC is a management Serious Game designed to raise awareness
      about the social issues of autism.

      The player takes on the role of General
      Manager of an inclusive IT company, managing employees and projects. Through
      reading candidate profiles and managing teams, the player is guided to understand
      the potential and challenges of neurodivergent people, developing empathy and
      awareness.

      The game highlights how autism can be a valuable resource
      in the workplace, encouraging inclusive strategies and careful human resource
      management.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2234312079273984
    m_Localized: Unlock new Departments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2234388373663744
    m_Localized: 'Each active department has its own screen, accessible by clicking
      the dedicated "Details" button.

      To unlock a new department, you need
      to click the "Unlock Department" button located above the panel of the department
      in question.

      Departments can only be unlocked in a predefined order.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
